WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.700
Speaker 1: A few of you from Canada wrote
to me about this and said, David, did you

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.700
hear that?

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:09.530
Joe Rogan has canceled his show in Vancouver,
Canada, over the vaccine requirement?

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:10.870
Yes, indeed, yes.

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:16.730
Indeed, for people who don't know what's going
on, Joe Rogan has called off a sold out comedy

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:21.720
show in Vancouver because of the vaccine requirement.

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:26.060
Vancouver City News writes popular podcast
podcast host and UFC commentator Joe Rogan

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:32.119
has confirmed he's canceled his 420 show,
meaning April 20th in Vancouver due to vaccine

00:00:32.119 --> 00:00:33.119
mandates.

00:00:33.119 --> 00:00:35.480
Speaking on a Christmas Eve episode of his
podcast.

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:39.570
He said quote, I should probably say this
because I haven't yet.

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:43.830
My 420 show that sold out in Vancouver, I
don't think that's happening.

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:46.100
I don't think I can even get into the country.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:47.860
I'm not vaccinated.

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:50.960
I'm not going to get vaccinated.

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:56.970
And subsequently also posting to his Facebook
page that that indeed is what's happening.

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:58.570
The show is getting canceled.

00:00:58.570 --> 00:01:02.600
Currently, people coming into Canada from
the U.S. must show proof of vaccination, and

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:07.159
a negative test proof of vaccination is also
required to attend events like the one Rogen

00:01:07.159 --> 00:01:08.159
had planned.

00:01:08.159 --> 00:01:11.840
So not only would Rogen need to be vaccinated
to go to Canada.

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:16.229
All of the attendees would need to show proof
of vaccination in order to go to the event

00:01:16.229 --> 00:01:17.920
itself, Rogen said.

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:22.729
He quote doesn't trust that Vancouver won't
cut capacity at arenas.

00:01:22.729 --> 00:01:27.659
However, the province made the move to restrict
capacity by 50 percent at venues with more

00:01:27.659 --> 00:01:31.939
than a thousand seats that was announced a
week before Rogen made the comments.

00:01:31.939 --> 00:01:37.209
Rogers Arena saying per the announcement of
the province of British Columbia, capacities

00:01:37.209 --> 00:01:41.029
will be reduced to 50 percent with rising
COVID cases.

00:01:41.029 --> 00:01:44.090
We keep working with local health authorities
to support each other.

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:48.740
Rogen has opposed vaccine mandates and to
some degree vaccinations and announced to

00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:53.499
his millions of followers in September that
he had indeed tested positive.

00:01:53.499 --> 00:02:01.579
I have to tell you, I have been so critical
of so many of the things that Joe Rogan said

00:02:01.579 --> 00:02:03.889
for so long about the vaccine.

00:02:03.889 --> 00:02:04.889
I think he's been.

00:02:04.889 --> 00:02:08.569
Dead wrong about so many of the things that
he said, many of you have written to me and

00:02:08.569 --> 00:02:13.290
that you've said, David, we appreciate that
you are willing to criticize Joe Rogan for

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:18.010
the things he says about the vaccine, because
so many of your other cohorts are not willing

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:19.430
or are not interested in doing that.

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:23.069
I think it's important to call things out
when you see them, when they don't make sense.

00:02:23.069 --> 00:02:28.310
But on this particular decision, I'm glad
to see Rogan make this decision.

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:30.239
What do I mean by that?

00:02:30.239 --> 00:02:38.209
It would actually be glaring hypocrisy, presumably
based on lining his pockets.

00:02:38.209 --> 00:02:45.150
If he said these things on the podcast for
a year or more and then went and said, Oh

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:51.469
yeah, and you got to be vaccinated to come
to my show and now I'm going to get vaccinated,

00:02:51.469 --> 00:02:53.299
only to be able to do the show and make money.

00:02:53.299 --> 00:02:58.219
Like, in other words, there's so much criticism
that I've made about Joe Rogan.

00:02:58.219 --> 00:03:03.939
It is logical to me, and it suggests that
at least it's not a grift what he's saying.

00:03:03.939 --> 00:03:06.180
He's misinformed.

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:09.400
He's been empirically wrong about many of
the things that he said.

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:17.260
He's brought on various guests who also say
things that are completely wrong, but he genuinely

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:22.140
seems to believe it and is not abandoning
it in order to just do the show and make the

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:23.890
money to some degree.

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:29.390
I'm glad to see that rather than him reversing
simply in order to be able to do the show

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:30.390
and make the money.

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:37.140
Now it's reported that the show is canceled,
but is also rescheduled for like almost a

00:03:37.140 --> 00:03:38.140
year from now.

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:42.180
So whether we call it a postponement or a
cancelation, it's not clear that you're no

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:45.980
longer going to need to be vaccinated in a
year to get into Canada.

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:47.220
So that remains to be seen.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:52.680
But to some degree, at least, he is sticking
by what he claims to say.

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:56.500
And if nothing else, it means he really believes
that he's wrong.

00:03:56.500 --> 00:04:00.980
He's wrong, but at least he seems to really
believe it and not be doing it for the clicks,

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:02.299
which I did not suspect.

00:04:02.299 --> 00:05:08.310
I suspected all along that as wrong as I believe
Joe Rogan is on this stuff, these really are

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:09.440
his beliefs

